  "Header": "MMC-JSI-V2.5",
  "APIProfile": "Basic",
  "Description": "JSON Interface for the Secretary of a meeting in the Metaverse (MMM). DRAFT. What a participant says to the Secretary becomes a User Command request (MMM-UCM, UserCommandRQ) - a summary in a language, written or spoken, the hand, the microphone, the screen, closing the meeting, going back to the meeting - and the User Command response (UserCommandRS) becomes the Response Hint, which the Secretary says in a few words. The application is the entries of its Access: the schema of the User Command (commands and responses) and the Application Context of the Secretary.",
